        <detaileddescription>
<para>Property: Base node associated with an integer.</para><para>When setting this property, the base node is changed without updating this object&apos;s relative value, thus this object&apos;s absolute value changes. The value returned by <ref refid="classSgAsmIntegerValueExpression_1a7163e72d51378a0a0d79f9ccc565f399" kindref="member">get_absoluteValue()</ref> will probably differ from what it would have returned before calling set_baseNode(). If this is not the behavior that&apos;s needed, see the <ref refid="classSgAsmIntegerValueExpression_1abe037857e6b03aaa0ab4a96e4f1f9d8a" kindref="member">makeRelativeTo()</ref> method.</para><para>The base node is not considered to be a child of this node in the AST. </para>        </detaileddescription>
